  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/26479c85-ea6a-4a23-9363-002fbc78b6c2-image.png\" style=\"width: 309px; height: 239px;\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;is mid point of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>G</mi></math> divides&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></math> in the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math> internally</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>G</mi></math>&nbsp;is centroid of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>